# Anchored to the top level on purpose. A bare `data/` matches at *any* depth, so
# it also ignored `drugrx/data/` -- the source package holding `splits.py`
# (the scaffold split behind every headline number in this programme),
# `standardise.py` (the InChIKey standardisation that caught 425 train/test
# collisions), `tdc.py` (the 21-endpoint registry and its pinned mirror row
# counts) and `multitask.py`. None of it was in version control, so no checkout
# could reproduce a single reported result. Keep the leading slash.
/data/
.venv/
__pycache__/
